# CODEOWNERS — #738 enforcement rails
# Gate paths require maintainer review. Combined with branch protection
# ("require review from code owners"), no agent-authored PR can modify the
# gates themselves: CI workflows, architecture-review verifier + signers,
# git hooks, graph baseline tooling, ADRs/conventions.
/.github/              @dev-brewery
/scripts/architecture/ @dev-brewery
/docs/architecture/signers/ @dev-brewery
/.husky/               @dev-brewery
/scripts/hooks/        @dev-brewery
/tools/graph/          @dev-brewery
/.claude/pipeline/     @dev-brewery
/docs/adr/             @dev-brewery
/docs/reference/       @dev-brewery
